<title>USA: Montgomery Ward names Grimes to executive posts.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Ward names Grimes to executive posts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Ward &amp; Co Inc said Thursday it appointed Thomas Grimes to the newly created position of president-hardlines and chief executive officer of Lechmere Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>He will report to Roger Goddu, chairman and chief executive officer of Montgomery Ward.</p>
<p>Before joining the privately held retailer, Grimes was managing director of Trimingham Bros. Ltd. in Bermuda.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
